//BSCFTCH  PROC
//*
//*  STARTED TASK PROCEDURE FOR THE BSC FILE FETCH APPLICATION.
//*  COPY THIS INTO SYS1.PROCLIB AS MEMBER BSCFTCH.
//*
//*    S BSCFTCH    to start      P BSCFTCH    to stop
//*
//*  BSCLINE MUST MATCH THE HERCULES BSC LINE ADDRESS - SEE
//*  hercules/bscline.conf.  CTLFILE IS THE VSAM KSDS DEFINED BY
//*  jcl/DEFCTL.jcl.  TIME=1440 BECAUSE THE TASK LOOPS UNTIL IT IS
//*  STOPPED.
//*
//BSCFTCH  EXEC PGM=BSCFTCH,TIME=1440
//STEPLIB  DD  DSN=TONYW.BSCFTCH.LOADLIB,DISP=SHR
//BSCLINE  DD  UNIT=090
//CTLFILE  DD  DSN=TONYW.BSCFTCH.CONTROL,DISP=SHR
//SYSUDUMP DD  SYSOUT=*
